cuems-videocomposer (0.1.2-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Journal logging: all LOG_* sites carry real syslog priorities via
    CuemsLogger under systemd (terminal output unchanged); MTC steady-
    state chatter demoted to debug (~36k journal lines/day -> hundreds);
    stdout printf error shadows removed; submodule pins converged on
    reconciled cuemslogger/mtcreceiver heads.

